# media/mac/readme.cmds — the README's Mac frames (docs/assets/screenshots/mac/).
# Run: SIZE=1280x800 script/capture.sh mac/readme
# `@REPO@` is the repository's root, opened as a project (a clone in a folder named `trek` reads
# best in the sidebar: SHOT_REPO=/path/to/trek).
# Ordering rule of thumb: `wait idle` only passes once every open turn has ended — so turns that
# stay open (a permission or plan card, a long build) come after the last `wait idle`.
# The mock agent picks its script by a keyword anywhere in the prompt ("subagents", "tools",
# "permission", "plan", "mock:long" …), so the prompts can read like real ones.
# The `wait 7000`s let the "Finished" toasts fade before a shot.

pace 0
glass off
theme night

# Finished threads in the project.
project @REPO@
send Review the API with two subagents 3s
wait idle 30000
project @REPO@
send Walk me through how the app starts
wait idle 30000
project @REPO@
send Add a --verbose flag to the CLI, use your tools
wait idle 30000
# The thread's side panel names the machine; the frames go without it.
click hub

# Threads that wait on a person, or keep working (outside the project, so the plan's thread
# isn't warned about another thread editing its folder).
route draft
send Apply the schema migration once I give permission
wait permission 20000
route draft
send Run the whole test suite on every platform mock:long 900s
wait 1500

# The hero: a plan waiting for approval, the sidebar showing what needs you.
project @REPO@
send Make a plan for session auth on every route
wait plan 20000
wait 7000
shot hero-night
theme paper
wait 800
shot hero-paper

# An approval card.
route title:Apply the schema
wait 800
shot approval-paper
theme night
wait 800
shot approval-night

# Basecamp: today across every thread.
route basecamp
wait 800
shot basecamp-night
theme paper
wait 800
shot basecamp-paper

# The editor, with the agent beside it.
route first
editor on
editor root @REPO@
editor view explorer
editor open @REPO@/crates/trek-app/src/workspace/worktrees.rs 60
editor ai on
wait 1500
shot editor-paper
theme night
wait 800
shot editor-night
editor ai off
editor off

quit
